{"parentUuid":"362483d2-e4ad-4e83-a25b-5b7a2ee5eb7c","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Check the CI status for PRs #42 and #43 on the Shadylukin/Neumann repo. For each:\n1. Run: gh pr checks 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann 2>&1\n2. Run: gh pr checks 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann 2>&1\n3. If there are failures, check the failure details - especially Clippy and build failures\n4. For #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8), check what criterion API changes are needed by looking at the bench files\n5. For #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20), check what tabled API is used in neumann_shell\n\nReport: which CI checks pass/fail, what code changes would be needed for each PR to work."}]},"uuid":"773503b8-5326-4cf9-9d97-905c8af82886","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:53:16.767Z"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"Check the CI status for PRs #42 and #43 on the Shadylukin/Neumann repo. For each:\n1. Run: gh pr checks 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann 2>&1\n2. Run: gh pr checks 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann 2>&1\n3. If there are failures, check the failure details - especially Clippy and build failures\n4. For #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8), check what criterion API changes are needed by looking at the bench files\n5. For #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20), check what tabled API is used in neumann_shell\n\nReport: which CI checks pass/fail, what code changes would be needed for each PR to work.","agentId":"a0944e019bb88b7c8"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_01EcgRprfQAupvyepQNfKaAL","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01HzFCXGiYN8Ncit5b2yYSgo","uuid":"fb384be3-bf76-4b61-8cff-01890ab7ad30","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:53:16.769Z"}
