ns/23022021989/job/66862296698\t\nTest\tpass\t25m25s\thttps://github.com/Shadylukin/Neumann/actions/runs/23022021989/job/66862296689\t\ncodecov/patch\tpass\t0\thttps://app.codecov.io/gh/Shadylukin/Neumann/pull/42"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"","agentId":"a0944e019bb88b7c8"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_01EcgRprfQAupvyepQNfKaAL","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01HzFCXGiYN8Ncit5b2yYSgo","uuid":"fe81f71b-41f4-4d92-a7c6-f3f17146bd1c","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:53:20.720Z"}
{"parentUuid":"fe81f71b-41f4-4d92-a7c6-f3f17146bd1c","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I need to understand how to fix Dependabot security alerts for aws-lc-sys in the Neumann project. The alerts are:\n- PKCS7_verify Certificate Chain Validation Bypass (alerts #19, #20)\n- Timing Side-Channel in AES-CCM Tag Verification (alerts #21, #22)\n- PKCS7_verify Signature Validation Bypass (alerts #23, #24)\n\nThese affect both Cargo.lock and neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock.\n\n1. Check the current aws-lc-sys version in Cargo.lock: grep -A2 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' Cargo.lock\n2. Check the same in neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\n3. Check what depends on aws-lc-sys: look for rustls, ring, or aws-lc-rs in Cargo.toml files\n4. Check if there's a patched version of aws-lc-sys that fixes these CVEs by searching for the latest version available\n5. Check if simply running `cargo update -p aws-lc-sys` would fix it\n\nReport what version we're on, what version we need, and whether a simple cargo update fixes it or if we need dependency changes."}]},"uuid":"83eb3f7a-0181-48a3-af2c-d54b38367608","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:53:21.427Z"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"I need to understand how to fix Dependabot security alerts for aws-lc-sys in the Neumann project. The alerts are:\n- PKCS7_verify Certificate Chain Validation Bypass (alerts #19, #20)\n- Timing Side-Channel in AES-CCM Tag Verification (alerts #21, #22)\n- PKCS7_verify Signature Validation Bypass (alerts #23, #24)\n\nThese affect both Cargo.lock and neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock.\n\n1. Check the current aws-lc-sys version in Cargo.lock: grep -A2 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' Cargo.lock\n2. Check the same in neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\n3. Check what depends on aws-lc-sys: look for rustls, ring, or aws-lc-rs in Cargo.toml files\n4. Check if there's a patched version of aws-lc-sys that fixes these CVEs by searching for the latest version available\n5. Check if simply running `cargo update -p aws-lc-sys` would fix it\n\nReport what version we're on, what version we need, and whether a simple cargo update fixes it or if we need dependency changes.","agentId":"a62fd5b7f554128a3"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_01EcgRprfQAupvyepQNfKaAL","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01XFg1KvDAu2ZAUwb8aFYHai","uuid":"8787b638-2cea-415c-8daf-4fb5ba36d7b0","timestamp":"2026-03-12T23:53:21.427Z"}
