{"parentUuid":"8e0255f9-35fb-496a-8e4d-51a737b83261","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SX9U4ULaqCtGRwb3peGw2D","type":"tool_result","content":"# Dependencies for tabled 0.20.0\n\nBased on the provided data, here are the dependencies:\n\n1. **papergrid** (^0.17) - Required dependency\n2. **ansi-str** (^0.9) - Optional dependency\n3. **ansitok** (^0.3) - Optional dependency\n4. **tabled_derive** (^0.11) - Optional dependency\n5. **testing_table** (^0.3) - Optional dependency\n\nAll dependencies are classified as normal (non-development) dependencies. The papergrid requirement uses default features disabled, while the optional dependencies use default features enabled. None of these packages specify additional feature flags or platform-specific targets."}]},"uuid":"1459c7f0-2728-46f4-9093-4f13d92f96fd","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:00:13.508Z"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"","agentId":"ad55a98516aea1158"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_011vunxUjTLB2UEc3fQjFCEq","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01PzySmwPEeqADbqkJdeKhub","uuid":"5649efcc-71ab-4edb-9e8b-581acc5884cc","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:00:13.509Z"}
