{"parentUuid":"9bc22271-8848-45ae-b3b6-6e7d17078075","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B2uP4J3bpDp1CC8262pTUU","type":"tool_result","content":"# Breaking Changes Between Criterion 0.5 and 0.8\n\nBased on the changelog, the document does **not explicitly list breaking changes** between versions 0.5 and 0.8. The only breaking change mentioned in this range is in version 0.8.0:\n\n**Version 0.8.0 Breaking Change:**\n- \"Drop async-std support\"\n\n## Regarding Specific APIs\n\nThe changelog does **not provide information** about whether these items remain available in 0.8:\n- `criterion_group`, `criterion_main`, `black_box`\n- `BenchmarkId`, `Criterion`, `Throughput`, `BatchSize`\n- `bench_function`, `bench_with_input`, `iter_batched`\n\nThe document only confirms these were available in earlier versions (0.3.4 added async support; 0.2.10 added `iter_batched`). Since no removal is documented for versions 0.6-0.8, their status remains unclear from this changelog alone.\n\n**Recommendation:** Consult the official API documentation or release notes for 0.6, 0.7, and 0.8 to verify the current availability of these specific functions and types."}]},"uuid":"2c4ca424-475d-4a90-8c3f-56b21e015544","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:08:50.323Z"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"","agentId":"ad55a98516aea1158"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_011vunxUjTLB2UEc3fQjFCEq","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01PzySmwPEeqADbqkJdeKhub","uuid":"465e0854-80c5-4efc-a7f5-e19f62e63b12","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:08:50.324Z"}
