{"parentUuid":"494fce16-abb6-4e77-88bb-2650999327e8","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NVRHto9xrfpbZfGUVdAvjR","type":"tool_result","content":"Title: deps(rust): bump the rust-minor group across 1 directory with 14 updates\nBranch: dependabot/cargo/rust-minor-a33c2ca1af\nBody: Bumps the rust-minor group with 14 updates in the / directory:\n\n| Package | From | To |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| [tokio](https://github.com/tokio-rs/tokio) | `1.49.0` | `1.50.0` |\n| [tonic](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) | `0.14.4` | `0.14.5` |\n| [tonic-prost](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) | `0.14.4` | `0.14.5` |\n| [tonic-prost-build](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) | `0.14.4` | `0.14.5` |\n| [uuid](https://github.com/uuid-rs/uuid) | `1.21.0` | `1.22.0` |\n| [clap](https://github.com/clap-rs/clap) | `4.5.59` | `4.6.0` |\n| [libc](https://github.com/rust-lang/libc) | `0.2.182` | `0.2.183` |\n| [owo-colors](https://github.com/owo-colors/owo-colors) | `4.2.3` | `4.3.0` |\n| [clap_complete](https://github.com/clap-rs/clap) | `4.5.66` | `4.6.0` |\n| [clap_mangen](https://github.com/clap-rs/clap) | `0.2.31` | `0.2.33` |\n| [rustls](https://github.com/rustls/rustls) | `0.23.36` | `0.23.37` |\n| [tonic-web](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) | `0.14.4` | `0.14.5` |\n| [tonic-reflection](https://github.com/hyperium/tonic) | `0.14.4` | `0.14.5` |\n| [serial_test](https://github.com/palfrey/serial_test) | `3.3.1` | `3.4.0` |\n\n\nUpdates `tokio` from 1.49.0 to 1.50.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/tokio-rs/tokio/releases\">tokio's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Tokio v1.50.0</h2>\n<h1>1.50.0 (Mar 3rd, 2026)</h1>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>net: add <code>TcpStream::set_zero_linger</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tokio-rs/tokio/issues/7837\">#7837</a>)</li>\n<li>rt: add <code>is_rt_shutdown_err</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tokio-rs/tokio/issues/7771\">#7771</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>io: add optimizer hint that <code>memchr</code> returns in-bounds pointer (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tokio-rs/tokio/issues/7792\">#7792</a>)</li>\n<li>io: implement vectored writes for <code>write_buf</code> (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/tokio-rs/tokio/issues/7871\">#7871</a>)</li>\n<l","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"56b6fd5e-2834-4d93-b272-b14fc702aa90","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:09:24.102Z"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"","agentId":"ad55a98516aea1158"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_011vunxUjTLB2UEc3fQjFCEq","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01PzySmwPEeqADbqkJdeKhub","uuid":"8f374417-bb59-46fb-a3a6-20bf1459f310","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:09:24.103Z"}
{"parentUuid":"8f374417-bb59-46fb-a3a6-20bf1459f310","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"assistant","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:09:28.598Z","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013F8F2yGmCYJkJq1tpqgu6H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QSKwEBGmjzDTR3uDozbjsK","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/rustls/0.23.37/dependencies","prompt":"What version of aws-lc-rs does rustls 0.23.37 depend on?"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1312,"cache_read_input_tokens":69092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1312,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"requestId":"req_011CYz7Cke8MpjNDnK7XFs5Z","uuid":"cf8a2426-739b-4823-8824-8c7e4893df6d"},"type":"agent_progress","prompt":"","agentId":"ad55a98516aea1158"},"toolUseID":"agent_msg_011vunxUjTLB2UEc3fQjFCEq","parentToolUseID":"toolu_01PzySmwPEeqADbqkJdeKhub","uuid":"7fc224f1-83c4-4eab-8a53-b0fff516d414","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:09:28.599Z"}
