{"parentUuid":"1701332a-80cf-4500-a538-6723dce59045","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01QbQamPhZMdWk9gVR7bW5NF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ph893pE3itDChebdv3TyDw","name":"ExitPlanMode","input":{"allowedPrompts":[{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo update to bump dependency versions"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo build to verify compilation"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo nextest to run tests"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo audit to check for vulnerabilities"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo fmt and cargo clippy for quality checks"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run gh pr merge to merge pull requests"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run gh pr checkout to check out PR branches"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run gh api to dismiss dependabot alerts"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run git add, commit, and push for lockfile updates"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run grep to verify dependency versions in lockfiles"}],"plan":"# Plan: Clear Remaining PRs + Fix Security Alerts\n\n## Context\n\nAfter merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution (aws-lc-sys CVEs + minimatch ReDoS). All items are low-risk dependency updates — no application logic changes.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys Security Alerts (#19-24)\n\n**Problem**: aws-lc-sys 0.37.x has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing side-channel). Affects both `Cargo.lock` (0.37.1) and `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` (0.37.0).\n\n**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` bumps aws-lc-rs 1.16.0 → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). No code changes — lockfile-only.\n\n**Commands**:\n```bash\n# Main workspace\ncargo update -p aws-lc-rs\ngrep 'aws-lc-sys' Cargo.lock  # verify 0.38.0\n\n# Python native\ncd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs\ngrep 'aws-lc-sys' Cargo.lock  # verify 0.38.0\n\n# Verify build\ncargo build --package neumann_server\ncargo nextest run --package neumann_server\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26\n\n**Problem**: Alert #26 flags minimatch ReDoS for range `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. But no minimatch 10.x is installed — only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9 exist in the lockfile. This is a false positive.\n\n**Fix**: Dismiss via API.\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\\n  -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\\n  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed. Only 3.x and 9.x in lockfile.\"\n```\n\n**Files**: None\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)\n\n**Problem**: tabled major version bump in neumann_shell.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly.\n\n```bash\ngh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)\n\n**Problem**: criterion major version bump. MSRV concern: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86, workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"`.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (all 16 bench targets compile and run). The criterion API used across all bench files (`criterion_group!`, `criterion_main!`, `bench_function`, `BenchmarkId`, `Throughput`, `black_box`) is unchanged. No MSRV CI job exists — only `toolchain: stable` (1.92+) is tested. The `rust-version = \"1.75\"` is aspirational and not enforced.\n\n**Fix**: Bump MSRV to match reality, then merge.\n\n```bash\n# On the PR branch, bump MSRV\ngh pr checkout 42\n# Edit Cargo.toml line 37: rust-version = \"1.75\" → \"1.86\"\ncargo build --package graph_engine  # verify\ngit add Cargo.toml && git commit -m \"Bump rust-version to 1.86 for criterion 0.8 compatibility\"\ngit push\ngh pr merge 42 --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.toml` (line 37)\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: Commit aws-lc-sys fix + push\n\nCreate a single commit on main with both lockfile updates from Step 1.\n\n```bash\ngit add Cargo.lock neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\ngit commit -m \"Update aws-lc-rs to 1.16.1 to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs\"\ngit push\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter all steps:\n```bash\n# Security audit\ncargo audit\n\n# Confirm no open alerts\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'\n\n# Confirm no open PRs\ngh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n1. aws-lc-sys lockfile update (Step 1 + 5) — on main, standalone commit\n2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only\n3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge\n4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — requires MSRV edit on PR branch first\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":738,"cache_read_input_tokens":153977,"output_tokens":286,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":738,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYz7PMkHQqPdqjcnSqHnf","type":"assistant","uuid":"3ad50bc2-4730-4ede-9f15-24cb4fcca6d7","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:11:54.393Z"}
