ncd fuzz && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ..\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' fuzz/Cargo.lock\n```\n\n**Verification** (full quality gates):\n```bash\ncargo fmt --check\ncargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings -D clippy::pedantic\ncargo nextest run --workspace\ncargo doc --no-deps\ncargo nextest run --package integration_tests\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`, `fuzz/Cargo.lock`\n\n**Commit on main**: `\"Update aws-lc-rs to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\"`\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26\n\n**Problem**: Alert flags minimatch ReDoS for `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. No minimatch 10.x is installed — only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9. False positive.\n\n**Fix**: Dismiss via API.\n```bash\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\\n  -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\\n  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed in lockfile.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)\n\n**Problem**: tabled major version bump in neumann_shell.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly.\n```bash\ngh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)\n\n**Problem**: criterion major version bump across all 16 bench targets.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms, bench compilation). The criterion API used across all bench files is unchanged in 0.8 (`criterion_group!`, `criterion_main!`, `bench_function`, `BenchmarkId`, `Throughput`, `black_box`).\n\n**MSRV**: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86. The workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"` (`Cargo.toml:37`). However, criterion is a **dev-dependency only** — it does not affect the published library's MSRV. Users building/installing Neumann won't pull criterion. Only `cargo bench` needs it, and CI uses stable (1.92+). **No MSRV change needed**. No documentation updates needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly — no code or MSRV changes.\n```bash\ngh pr merge 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification (after all steps)\n\n```bash\n# Security audit\ncargo audit\n\n# Confirm alerts resolved\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts \\\n  --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'\n\n# Confirm no open PRs\ngh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n1. aws-lc-sys lockfile updates on main (Step 1) — standalone commit\n2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only\n3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge\n4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — direct merge\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":2,"oldLines":49,"newStart":2,"newLines":66,"lines":[" "," ## Context"," ","-After merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution (aws-lc-sys CVEs + minimatch ReDoS). All items are low-risk dependency updates — no application logic changes.","+After merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution. All items are dependency updates — no application logic changes."," "," ---"," ","-## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys Security Alerts (#19-24)","+## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles"," ","-**Problem**: aws-lc-sys 0.37.x has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing side-channel). Affects both `Cargo.lock` (0.37.1) and `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` (0.37.0).","+**Problem**: aws-lc-sys has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing). Current versions:"," ","-**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` bumps aws-lc-rs 1.16.0 → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). No code changes — lockfile-only.","+| Lockfile | aws-lc-sys version | Status |","+|----------|-------------------|--------|","+| `Cargo.lock` | 0.37.1 | Vulnerable |","+| `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` | 0.37.0 | Vulnerable |","+| `fuzz/Cargo.lock` | 0.35.0 | Vulnerable |","+| `demos/knowledge-galaxy/Cargo.lock` | 0.38.0 | Already patched |"," ","+**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` in each workspace bumps aws-lc-rs → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). Lockfile-only changes.","+","+**Goal**: Full repo cleanup — update ALL vulnerable lockfiles, not just the two with Dependabot alerts.","+"," **Commands**:"," ```bash"," # Main workspace"," cargo update -p aws-lc-rs","-grep 'aws-lc-sys' Cargo.lock  # verify 0.38.0","+grep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' Cargo.lock"," "," # Python native","-cd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs","-grep 'aws-lc-sys' Cargo.lock  # verify 0.38.0","+cd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ../..","+grep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock"," ","-# Verify build","-cargo build --package neumann_server","-cargo nextest run --package neumann_server","+# Fuzz (separate workspace, in exclude list)","+cd fuzz && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ..","+grep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' fuzz/Cargo.lock"," ```"," ","-**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`","+**Verification** (full quality gates):","+```bash","+cargo fmt --check","+cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings -D clippy::pedantic","+cargo nextest run --workspace","+cargo doc --no-deps","+cargo nextest run --package integration_tests","+```"," ","+**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`, `fuzz/Cargo.lock`","+","+**Commit on main**: `\"Update aws-lc-rs to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\"`","+"," ---"," "," ## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26"," ","-**Problem**: Alert #26 flags minimatch ReDoS for range `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. But no minimatch 10.x is installed — only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9 exist in the lockfile. This is a false positive.","+**Problem**: Alert flags minimatch ReDoS for `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. No minimatch 10.x is installed — only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9. False positive."," "," **Fix**: Dismiss via API.","-"," ```bash"," gh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\","   -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\","-  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed. Only 3.x and 9.x in lockfile.\"","+  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed in lockfile.\""," ```"," ","-**Files**: None","-"," ---"," "," ## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)"]},{"oldStart":54,"oldLines":7,"newStart":71,"newLines":6,"lines":[" **Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed."," "," **Fix**: Merge directly.","-"," ```bash"," gh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch"," ```"]},{"oldStart":63,"oldLines":47,"newStart":79,"newLines":28,"lines":[" "," ## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)"," ","-**Problem**: criterion major version bump. MSRV concern: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86, workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"`.","+**Problem**: criterion major version bump across all 16 bench targets."," ","-**Analysis**: CI passes (all 16 bench targets compile and run). The criterion API used across all bench files (`criterion_group!`, `criterion_main!`, `bench_function`, `BenchmarkId`, `Throughput`, `black_box`) is unchanged. No MSRV CI job exists — only `toolchain: stable` (1.92+) is tested. The `rust-version = \"1.75\"` is aspirational and not enforced.","+**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms, bench compilation). The criterion API used across all bench files is unchanged in 0.8 (`criterion_group!`, `criterion_main!`, `bench_function`, `BenchmarkId`, `Throughput`, `black_box`)."," ","-**Fix**: Bump MSRV to match reality, then merge.","+**MSRV**: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86. The workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"` (`Cargo.toml:37`). However, criterion is a **dev-dependency only** — it does not affect the published library's MSRV. Users building/installing Neumann won't pull criterion. Only `cargo bench` needs it, and CI uses stable (1.92+). **No MSRV change needed**. No documentation updates needed."," ","+**Fix**: Merge directly — no code or MSRV changes."," ```bash","-# On the PR branch, bump MSRV","-gh pr checkout 42","-# Edit Cargo.toml line 37: rust-version = \"1.75\" → \"1.86\"","-cargo build --package graph_engine  # verify","-git add Cargo.toml && git commit -m \"Bump rust-version to 1.86 for criterion 0.8 compatibility\"","-git push","-gh pr merge 42 --squash --delete-branch","+gh pr merge 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch"," ```"," ","-**Files**: `Cargo.toml` (line 37)","-"," ---"," ","-## Step 5: Commit aws-lc-sys fix + push","+## Verification (after all steps)"," ","-Create a single commit on main with both lockfile updates from Step 1.","-"," ```bash","-git add Cargo.lock neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock","-git commit -m \"Update aws-lc-rs to 1.16.1 to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs\"","-git push","-```","-","----","-","-## Verification","-","-After all steps:","-```bash"," # Security audit"," cargo audit"," ","-# Confirm no open alerts","-gh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'","+# Confirm alerts resolved","+gh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts \\","+  --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'"," "," # Confirm no open PRs"," gh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open"]},{"oldStart":111,"oldLines":7,"newStart":108,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," ## Execution Order"," ","-1. aws-lc-sys lockfile update (Step 1 + 5) — on main, standalone commit","+1. aws-lc-sys lockfile updates on main (Step 1) — standalone commit"," 2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only"," 3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge","-4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — requires MSRV edit on PR branch first","+4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — direct merge"]}],"originalFile":"# Plan: Clear Remaining PRs + Fix Security Alerts\n\n## Context\n\nAfter merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution (aws-lc-sys CVEs + minimatch ReDoS). All items are low-risk dependency updates — no application logic changes.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys Security Alerts (#19-24)\n\n**Problem**: aws-lc-sys 0.37.x has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing side-channel). Affects both `Cargo.lock` (0.37.1) and `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` (0.37.0).\n\n**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` bumps aws-lc-rs 1.16.0 → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). No code changes — lockfile-only.\n\n**Commands**:\n```bash\n# Main workspace\ncargo update -p aws-lc-rs\ngrep 'aws-lc-sys' Cargo.lock  # verify 0.38.0\n\n# Python native\ncd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs\ngrep 'aws-lc-sys' Cargo.lock  # verify 0.38.0\n\n# Verify build\ncargo build --package neumann_server\ncargo nextest run --package neumann_server\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26\n\n**Problem**: Alert #26 flags minimatch ReDoS for range `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. But no minimatch 10.x is installed — only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9 exist in the lockfile. This is a false positive.\n\n**Fix**: Dismiss via API.\n\n```bash\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\\n  -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\\n  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed. Only 3.x and 9.x in lockfile.\"\n```\n\n**Files**: None\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)\n\n**Problem**: tabled major version bump in neumann_shell.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly.\n\n```bash\ngh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)\n\n**Problem**: criterion major version bump. MSRV concern: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86, workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"`.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (all 16 bench targets compile and run). The criterion API used across all bench files (`criterion_group!`, `criterion_main!`, `bench_function`, `BenchmarkId`, `Throughput`, `black_box`) is unchanged. No MSRV CI job exists — only `toolchain: stable` (1.92+) is tested. The `rust-version = \"1.75\"` is aspirational and not enforced.\n\n**Fix**: Bump MSRV to match reality, then merge.\n\n```bash\n# On the PR branch, bump MSRV\ngh pr checkout 42\n# Edit Cargo.toml line 37: rust-version = \"1.75\" → \"1.86\"\ncargo build --package graph_engine  # verify\ngit add Cargo.toml && git commit -m \"Bump rust-version to 1.86 for criterion 0.8 compatibility\"\ngit push\ngh pr merge 42 --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.toml` (line 37)\n\n---\n\n## Step 5: Commit aws-lc-sys fix + push\n\nCreate a single commit on main with both lockfile updates from Step 1.\n\n```bash\ngit add Cargo.lock neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\ngit commit -m \"Update aws-lc-rs to 1.16.1 to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs\"\ngit push\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification\n\nAfter all steps:\n```bash\n# Security audit\ncargo audit\n\n# Confirm no open alerts\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'\n\n# Confirm no open PRs\ngh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n1. aws-lc-sys lockfile update (Step 1 + 5) — on main, standalone commit\n2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only\n3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge\n4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — requires MSRV edit on PR branch first\n"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4286f9f2-c015-4e7f-a2bb-dacc3cd6c0cd"}
{"parentUuid":"396c3888-6c0b-4245-98c2-05023ea9e18e","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019ATZ3wRuMmsASRiKhDrQze","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012yeYFFp5XZjbuxG1CtBjND","name":"ExitPlanMode","input":{"allowedPrompts":[{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo update to bump dependency versions in lockfiles"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo fmt, clippy, nextest, and doc for quality gates"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run cargo audit to verify security fixes"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run gh pr merge to merge pull requests"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run gh api to dismiss dependabot alerts"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run git add, commit, and push for lockfile updates"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run grep to verify dependency versions in lockfiles"},{"tool":"Bash","prompt":"run gh pr list to verify no remaining PRs"}],"plan":"# Plan: Clear Remaining PRs + Fix Security Alerts\n\n## Context\n\nAfter merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution. All items are dependency updates — no application logic changes.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\n\n**Problem**: aws-lc-sys has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing). Current versions:\n\n| Lockfile | aws-lc-sys version | Status |\n|----------|-------------------|--------|\n| `Cargo.lock` | 0.37.1 | Vulnerable |\n| `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` | 0.37.0 | Vulnerable |\n| `fuzz/Cargo.lock` | 0.35.0 | Vulnerable |\n| `demos/knowledge-galaxy/Cargo.lock` | 0.38.0 | Already patched |\n\n**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` in each workspace bumps aws-lc-rs → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). Lockfile-only changes.\n\n**Goal**: Full repo cleanup — update ALL vulnerable lockfiles, not just the two with Dependabot alerts.\n\n**Commands**:\n```bash\n# Main workspace\ncargo update -p aws-lc-rs\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' Cargo.lock\n\n# Python native\ncd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ../..\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\n\n# Fuzz (separate workspace, in exclude list)\ncd fuzz && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ..\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' fuzz/Cargo.lock\n```\n\n**Verification** (full quality gates):\n```bash\ncargo fmt --check\ncargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings -D clippy::pedantic\ncargo nextest run --workspace\ncargo doc --no-deps\ncargo nextest run --package integration_tests\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`, `fuzz/Cargo.lock`\n\n**Commit on main**: `\"Update aws-lc-rs to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\"`\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26\n\n**Problem**: Alert flags minimatch ReDoS for `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. No minimatch 10.x is installed — only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9. False positive.\n\n**Fix**: Dismiss via API.\n```bash\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\\n  -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\\n  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed in lockfile.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)\n\n**Problem**: tabled major version bump in neumann_shell.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly.\n```bash\ngh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)\n\n**Problem**: criterion major version bump across all 16 bench targets.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms, bench compilation). The criterion API used across all bench files is unchanged in 0.8 (`criterion_group!`, `criterion_main!`, `bench_function`, `BenchmarkId`, `Throughput`, `black_box`).\n\n**MSRV**: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86. The workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"` (`Cargo.toml:37`). However, criterion is a **dev-dependency only** — it does not affect the published library's MSRV. Users building/installing Neumann won't pull criterion. Only `cargo bench` needs it, and CI uses stable (1.92+). **No MSRV change needed**. No documentation updates needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly — no code or MSRV changes.\n```bash\ngh pr merge 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification (after all steps)\n\n```bash\n# Security audit\ncargo audit\n\n# Confirm alerts resolved\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts \\\n  --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'\n\n# Confirm no open PRs\ngh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n1. aws-lc-sys lockfile updates on main (Step 1) — standalone commit\n2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only\n3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge\n4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — direct merge\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2466,"cache_read_input_tokens":157775,"output_tokens":242,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2466,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYz93MpRP7MxBEfi3UTKZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"5d3342a2-f9ab-4460-a8dd-40fe99c2014f","timestamp":"2026-03-13T00:33:37.069Z"}
