{"parentUuid":"f3b174d0-09fe-43f9-875e-affa684df4e1","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0113xyfFwjJ6637s9D1bQ5cY","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Plan: Clear Remaining PRs + Fix Security Alerts\n     2→\n     3→## Context\n     4→\n     5→After merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution. All items are dependency updates — no application logic changes.\n     6→\n     7→---\n     8→\n     9→## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\n    10→\n    11→**Problem**: aws-lc-sys has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing). Current versions:\n    12→\n    13→| Lockfile | aws-lc-sys version | Status |\n    14→|----------|-------------------|--------|\n    15→| `Cargo.lock` | 0.37.1 | Vulnerable |\n    16→| `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` | 0.37.0 | Vulnerable |\n    17→| `fuzz/Cargo.lock` | 0.35.0 | Vulnerable |\n    18→| `demos/knowledge-galaxy/Cargo.lock` | 0.38.0 | Already patched |\n    19→\n    20→**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` in each workspace bumps aws-lc-rs → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). Lockfile-only changes.\n    21→\n    22→**Goal**: Full repo cleanup — update ALL vulnerable lockfiles, not just the two with Dependabot alerts.\n    23→\n    24→**Commands**:\n    25→```bash\n    26→# Main workspace\n    27→cargo update -p aws-lc-rs\n    28→grep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' Cargo.lock\n    29→\n    30→# Python native (excluded from root workspace at Cargo.toml:25)\n    31→cd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ../..\n    32→grep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\n    33→\n    34→# Fuzz (excluded from root workspace at Cargo.toml:25)\n    35→cd fuzz && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ..\n    36→grep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' fuzz/Cargo.lock\n    37→```\n    38→\n    39→**Verification** — each workspace verified separately since they are excluded from root:\n    40→\n    41→Root workspace:\n    42→```bash\n    43→cargo fmt --check\n    44→cargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings -D clippy::pedantic\n    45→cargo nextest run --workspace\n    46→cargo doc --no-deps\n    47→cargo nextest run --package integration_tests\n    48→```\n    49→\n    50→Excluded workspaces (lockfile-only changes, verify they resolve):\n    51→```bash\n    52→cd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo check && cd ../..\n    53→cd fuzz && cargo check && cd ..\n    54→```\n    55→\n    56→**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`, `fuzz/Cargo.lock`\n    57→\n    58→**Commit on main**: `\"Update aws-lc-rs to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\"`\n    59→\n    60→---\n    61→\n    62→## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26\n    63→\n    64→**Problem**: Alert flags minimatch ReDoS for `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. No minimatch 10.x is installed in `neumann-ts/package-lock.json` — only 3.1.5 (`package-lock.json:2768`) and 9.0.9 (`package-lock.json:596`). False positive.\n    65→\n    66→**Fix**: Dismiss via API.\n    67→```bash\n    68→gh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\\n    69→  -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\\n    70→  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed in neumann-ts/package-lock.json. Only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9 are present.\"\n    71→```\n    72→\n    73→---\n    74→\n    75→## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)\n    76→\n    77→**Problem**: tabled major version bump in neumann_shell.\n    78→\n    79→**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` (`table.rs:7-57`) which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed.\n    80→\n    81→**Fix**: Merge directly.\n    82→```bash\n    83→gh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n    84→```\n    85→\n    86→---\n    87→\n    88→## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)\n    89→\n    90→**Problem**: criterion major version bump. Defined once at workspace root (`Cargo.toml:98`) and consumed by 16 crates via `[dev-dependencies] criterion.workspace = true`.\n    91→\n    92→**Analysis**: The CI for this PR ran Clippy and tests, but the bench-pr workflow (`bench-pr.yml:4-14`) only triggers on crate `src/**` or `**/benches/**` path changes and only benchmarks changed crates (`bench-pr.yml:31-57`). A root-only `Cargo.toml` version bump does NOT trigger bench compilation through CI. Therefore we must **locally compile all bench targets** before merging.\n    93→\n    94→**MSRV**: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86. The workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"` (`Cargo.toml:37`). Criterion is a **dev-dependency only** — it does not affect the published library's MSRV. Users building/installing Neumann won't pull criterion. Only `cargo bench` needs it, and CI uses stable (1.92+). **No MSRV change needed**. No documentation updates needed.\n    95→\n    96→**Fix**: Check out PR branch, verify bench compilation locally, then merge.\n    97→```bash\n    98→# Check out PR branch and pull latest main\n    99→gh pr checkout 42\n   100→\n   101→# Compile ALL bench targets without running them\n   102→cargo bench --workspace --bench '*' --no-run \\\n   103→  --exclude fuzz --exclude integration_tests --exclude stress_tests\n   104→\n   105→# If compilation succeeds, merge\n   106→gh pr merge 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n   107→```\n   108→\n   109→---\n   110→\n   111→## Verification (after all steps)\n   112→\n   113→```bash\n   114→# Security audit (root workspace)\n   115→cargo audit\n   116→\n   117→# Confirm alerts resolved\n   118→gh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts \\\n   119→  --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'\n   120→\n   121→# Confirm no open PRs\n   122→gh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open\n   123→```\n   124→\n   125→## Execution Order\n   126→\n   127→1. aws-lc-sys lockfile updates on main (Step 1) — standalone commit\n   128→2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only\n   129→3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge\n   130→4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — local bench compilation check, then merge\n   131→"}]},"uuid":"dcf100e6-fbb8-4573-a9ce-3ce266086797","timestamp":"2026-03-13T01:20:37.245Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/lukin/.claude/plans/mighty-hugging-umbrella.md","content":"# Plan: Clear Remaining PRs + Fix Security Alerts\n\n## Context\n\nAfter merging PR #65 and 8 Dependabot PRs, 2 PRs remain open (#42, #43) and 6 Dependabot security alerts need resolution. All items are dependency updates — no application logic changes.\n\n---\n\n## Step 1: Fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\n\n**Problem**: aws-lc-sys has 3 CVEs (PKCS7_verify bypass x2, AES-CCM timing). Current versions:\n\n| Lockfile | aws-lc-sys version | Status |\n|----------|-------------------|--------|\n| `Cargo.lock` | 0.37.1 | Vulnerable |\n| `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock` | 0.37.0 | Vulnerable |\n| `fuzz/Cargo.lock` | 0.35.0 | Vulnerable |\n| `demos/knowledge-galaxy/Cargo.lock` | 0.38.0 | Already patched |\n\n**Fix**: `cargo update -p aws-lc-rs` in each workspace bumps aws-lc-rs → 1.16.1 which pulls aws-lc-sys 0.38.0 (patched). Lockfile-only changes.\n\n**Goal**: Full repo cleanup — update ALL vulnerable lockfiles, not just the two with Dependabot alerts.\n\n**Commands**:\n```bash\n# Main workspace\ncargo update -p aws-lc-rs\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' Cargo.lock\n\n# Python native (excluded from root workspace at Cargo.toml:25)\ncd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ../..\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock\n\n# Fuzz (excluded from root workspace at Cargo.toml:25)\ncd fuzz && cargo update -p aws-lc-rs && cd ..\ngrep -A1 'name = \"aws-lc-sys\"' fuzz/Cargo.lock\n```\n\n**Verification** — each workspace verified separately since they are excluded from root:\n\nRoot workspace:\n```bash\ncargo fmt --check\ncargo clippy --workspace -- -D warnings -D clippy::pedantic\ncargo nextest run --workspace\ncargo doc --no-deps\ncargo nextest run --package integration_tests\n```\n\nExcluded workspaces (lockfile-only changes, verify they resolve):\n```bash\ncd neumann-py/neumann-native && cargo check && cd ../..\ncd fuzz && cargo check && cd ..\n```\n\n**Files**: `Cargo.lock`, `neumann-py/neumann-native/Cargo.lock`, `fuzz/Cargo.lock`\n\n**Commit on main**: `\"Update aws-lc-rs to fix aws-lc-sys CVEs across all lockfiles\"`\n\n---\n\n## Step 2: Dismiss minimatch Alert #26\n\n**Problem**: Alert flags minimatch ReDoS for `>= 10.0.0, < 10.2.3`. No minimatch 10.x is installed in `neumann-ts/package-lock.json` — only 3.1.5 (`package-lock.json:2768`) and 9.0.9 (`package-lock.json:596`). False positive.\n\n**Fix**: Dismiss via API.\n```bash\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts/26 \\\n  -X PATCH -f state=dismissed -f dismissed_reason=not_impacted \\\n  -f dismissed_comment=\"No minimatch 10.x installed in neumann-ts/package-lock.json. Only 3.1.5 and 9.0.9 are present.\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 3: Merge PR #43 (tabled 0.17 → 0.20)\n\n**Problem**: tabled major version bump in neumann_shell.\n\n**Analysis**: CI passes (Clippy, Test, all platforms). The only tabled consumer is `neumann_shell/src/output/table.rs` (`table.rs:7-57`) which uses `Table::from_iter()`, `Style::rounded()`, `Rows::first()`, `Modify`, `Alignment` — all unchanged in 0.20. No code changes needed.\n\n**Fix**: Merge directly.\n```bash\ngh pr merge 43 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Step 4: Merge PR #42 (criterion 0.5 → 0.8)\n\n**Problem**: criterion major version bump. Defined once at workspace root (`Cargo.toml:98`) and consumed by 16 crates via `[dev-dependencies] criterion.workspace = true`.\n\n**Analysis**: The CI for this PR ran Clippy and tests, but the bench-pr workflow (`bench-pr.yml:4-14`) only triggers on crate `src/**` or `**/benches/**` path changes and only benchmarks changed crates (`bench-pr.yml:31-57`). A root-only `Cargo.toml` version bump does NOT trigger bench compilation through CI. Therefore we must **locally compile all bench targets** before merging.\n\n**MSRV**: criterion 0.8 requires Rust 1.86. The workspace declares `rust-version = \"1.75\"` (`Cargo.toml:37`). Criterion is a **dev-dependency only** — it does not affect the published library's MSRV. Users building/installing Neumann won't pull criterion. Only `cargo bench` needs it, and CI uses stable (1.92+). **No MSRV change needed**. No documentation updates needed.\n\n**Fix**: Check out PR branch, verify bench compilation locally, then merge.\n```bash\n# Check out PR branch and pull latest main\ngh pr checkout 42\n\n# Compile ALL bench targets without running them\ncargo bench --workspace --bench '*' --no-run \\\n  --exclude fuzz --exclude integration_tests --exclude stress_tests\n\n# If compilation succeeds, merge\ngh pr merge 42 --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --squash --delete-branch\n```\n\n---\n\n## Verification (after all steps)\n\n```bash\n# Security audit (root workspace)\ncargo audit\n\n# Confirm alerts resolved\ngh api repos/Shadylukin/Neumann/dependabot/alerts \\\n  --jq '[.[] | select(.state==\"open\")] | length'\n\n# Confirm no open PRs\ngh pr list --repo Shadylukin/Neumann --state open\n```\n\n## Execution Order\n\n1. aws-lc-sys lockfile updates on main (Step 1) — standalone commit\n2. Dismiss alert #26 (Step 2) — API call only\n3. Merge PR #43 tabled (Step 3) — direct merge\n4. Merge PR #42 criterion (Step 4) — local bench compilation check, then merge\n","numLines":131,"startLine":1,"totalLines":131}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f3b174d0-09fe-43f9-875e-affa684df4e1"}
